Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Goat Team Go Go Go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy lied and claimed to be the basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Unexpectedly, Wolnie and Wilie dropped by for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy put on an act to cover it up, but his teammate exposed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, Wolnie saw through the lie but didn’t say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She firmly believed Wolffy would succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This strengthened Wolffy’s resolve to become the basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather ’round!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After overcoming so many difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the Goat Clan’s basketball team has finally been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The start of the game is just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the hard work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any words of encouragement for the team?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Less talk, more training.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, we trained in basketball under Coach Blazey’s guidance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and learned about the game from Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We practiced day and night,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and our basketball skills steadily improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the long-awaited day arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the opening day of the Grassland Basketball Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You are about to face a series of formidable teams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,in match after match of tough competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And your performance will change how everyone views the Goat Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the name of the Goat Clan’s basketball team ring out across the entire grassland!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what’s our team name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, we don’t seem to have a team name yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s call it the Super Muscle Team—strong and powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s too crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the Butterfly Team? That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you think so, Jonie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No. That’s too girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s call it the Grass Cake Team; it sounds delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Super Muscle Team is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Butterfly Team is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Grass Cake Team is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that’s not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stop arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let a team name affect our relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, let’s call it Team Weslie and His Friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it only your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,—No way.　—Grass Cake Team is better.　—Stop arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the captain decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get on the bus, the opening ceremony is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who is our captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like it hasn’t been decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the team leader
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll do it. I’ll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, don’t take the bus; run to the venue instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever gets there first becomes the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Game on—I’m not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep you from picking such a crude name,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we girls won’t back down either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Jonie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it—don’t let Weslie and Sparky beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I’ll just take the bus; the team name isn’t that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, the captain is the core of the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides deciding the team name, they also get to decide what to eat every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Being the captain is an honor and a responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That responsibility is one I must shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, let’s give it our all, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let them beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s all just take the bus together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about the captain and the team name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take the bus and head to the venue first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us see who arrives first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain’s position is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you’d better run fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to lose some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m heading off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only first place gets to be captain; who would fall for your trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to climb mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside; don’t block the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re in a rush to get to the Basketball Game; don’t block our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the attitude? We’re heading there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They have great stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m now a reserve player for the Wolf Clan basketball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m on my way to check in for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You got into the Wolf Clan basketball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don’t tell me you guys are also…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right. We’re going to represent Goat Clan and achieve great results in the Basketball Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll make everyone look at Goat Clan in a whole new light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s hurry to the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We were waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What exactly do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing much—just wanted to knock you down a peg right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge is actually broken. You probably won’t make it to the venue now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t crossed over yet—don’t leave me behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those wolves went too far—they even abandoned their own teammate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to beat them on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the bridge is broken; how are we supposed to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, everyone. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven’t the kids arrived yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re also from the Goat Team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What business does the Goat Clan have playing basketball? You should just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Our coach is incredibly skilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey! Blazey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your coach probably bailed at the last minute, and the players can’t come either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The players can’t come? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,On our way here, we accidentally broke the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little goats can’t come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The kids are in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; they’ll definitely get here safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I not worry? They’re still just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to go check on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really have so little faith in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re worried too, aren’t you? Your palm is sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just washed my hands after using the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s all gather some more vines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the point of gathering vines? The bridge is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we stick together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,even if the bridge is broken and the road is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we can still forge a new path.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we can definitely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three—let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we cross the river, we’ll be at the venue soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep going, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t walk so fast; it’s too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay; the water isn’t deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we stick together, we don’t need to fear any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right—let’s go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The venue is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get so dirty? Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You all arrive together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who’s going to be the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We all agreed that Weslie should be our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever we face danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you always encourage us and bring us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the perfect one to be the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so glad you’re all alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With me, Wolffy, around, what could possibly go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you’re here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy is also participating in the Basketball Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry and meet up with those reserve players.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Those wolves were Team Wolves’ reserve players?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:11:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course; Victor and the others have already arrived at the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Team Wolves’ starting players must be even more formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how tough they are, we can definitely beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let’s hurry up and register.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s your team name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, it’s your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We must defend the dignity and dreams of the Goat Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s call our team the Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are so many teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, everyone, to this year’s Super Basketball Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The lineup of participating teams this year is truly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Each team has its own unique style of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The upcoming matches are sure to be spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To accommodate the players from every team,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we have specially built this basketball city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to the competition venues,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we have prepared facilities for accommodation, training, and more for every team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Players who have traveled from afar can rest and train here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,ensuring everyone is in peak condition for the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby declare this year’s Super Basketball Cup officially open.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
